# What must never reach this repository. It is exported, file by file, to a public one
# (scripts/export-public.sh), so anything that lands here lands in the open.
#
# .gitignore is the first net, not the last: it only stops files nobody has added yet, and `git add -f` walks past it.
# The one that actually holds is scripts/text-hygiene.test.mjs, which refuses a tracked file that looks like a secret,
# a run's output or an ownership claim of ours, and fails the build. Add a pattern in both places.

# --- Dependencies and build output ---
node_modules/
coverage/
.nyc_output/
dist/
build/

# --- Secrets and credentials ---
# The owner's values live on the host, in /etc/pos and /etc/stp, and are typed there. Nothing of the sort belongs here,
# not even as an example with a real value in it.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!*.env.example
secrets.*
*.secret
*.secrets
credentials.*
*.credentials
.npmrc
.netrc
.pgpass
rclone.conf
.aws/
.ssh/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.ppk

# --- Proofs that we own something ---
# A claim is worth something only while it is served from our own origin, and publishing one invites trouble for
# nothing. Glama's lives in /etc/pos/web.env on the host (deployment/PUBLISHING.md).
glama*.json
*.claim

# --- Data ---
# The archive is the product's own memory, and the owner's standing rule is that dataset rows never enter git.
# Synthetic fixtures under tests/ are the one exception, because they are written by hand rather than by a run.
data/
datasets/
exports/
dumps/
*.jsonl
!tests/**/*.jsonl
/*.csv
/*.parquet
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# --- What a run writes, wherever it is pointed ---
hits-????-??-??.jsonl
stock-peg-????-??-??.jsonl
stock-peg-runs-????-??-??.jsonl
cases-????-??-??.jsonl
registry-????-??-??.jsonl
manifest-????-??-??.json
*.ots
*.tmp
*.tmp-*
*.pid
*.sock
*.log

# --- Local tooling and editors ---
.claude/
.zcode/
.codex/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Mutation testing, which leaves a marker if it is interrupted ---
.mutation-run-in-progress
.mutation-run-in-progress.compromised

# --- The paid-pass module is a host file (owner, 15.11) ---
# The money path does not belong in a repository that is exported to a public one. evm/core/stocks/x402.mjs and its
# test live on the host beside the app, the way the anchor key does: copied there by hand, left untouched by a deploy
# (git pull keeps ignored files), and backed up with the host's own config. apps/stocks-web.mjs imports it optionally:
# a checkout without it is the free service exactly.
evm/core/stocks/x402.mjs
evm/core/stocks/x402.test.mjs
